read /proc/self/stat                               AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
read /proc/1/stat (root process)                   AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
read /proc/1/cmdline                               AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
bind AF_UNIX socket in /tmp                        AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
sqlite write in own dir                            AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
read /root (another uid's directory)               DENIED
read /etc/shadow                                   DENIED
btrfs subvolume snapshot /                         DENIED
mount a tmpfs                                      DENIED
unshare a user namespace                           AVAILABLE (unprivileged)
